# --- AI assistant / agent local state ------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything under .claude/ (settings, local overrides, session data) stays private, at any depth.
# The two exceptions, at the repository root only: the project skills (.claude/skills/, published
# playbooks, see AGENTS.md) and the shared settings file (.claude/settings.json, deny rules that keep
# secrets unread). The publishing gate allows exactly these two.
**/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/settings.json
CLAUDE.local.md
.aider*

